# 基础词 Unit 05 短语

## 常考短语

- **set boundaries**: 设定界限 — It's important to set boundaries in relationships. 在关系中设定界限很重要。
- **brand new**: 全新的 — She bought a brand new car. 她买了一辆全新的车。
- **be brave enough to**: 足够勇敢去做 — She was brave enough to speak up. 她足够勇敢地站出来说话。
- **make a breakthrough**: 取得突破 — Scientists made a breakthrough in AI research. 科学家在人工智能研究方面取得了突破。
- **in brief**: 简而言之 — In brief, the project was a success. 简而言之，项目是成功的。
- **broaden one's horizons**: 开阔眼界 — Travel helps broaden your horizons. 旅行有助于开阔眼界。
- **on a budget**: 预算有限 — We're traveling on a budget this year. 我们今年预算有限地旅行。
- **be a burden on**: 成为…的负担 — The debt is a burden on the family. 债务是家庭的负担。
- **burst into tears**: 突然哭起来 — She burst into tears when she heard the news. 她听到消息后突然哭了起来。
- **be capable of**: 有能力做 — He is capable of great things. 他有能力做大事。
- **have the capacity to**: 有能力做 — The hospital has the capacity to treat 500 patients. 医院有能力治疗500名患者。
- **launch a campaign**: 发起运动 — The organization launched a campaign against poverty. 该组织发起了一场反贫困运动。
- **cancel a reservation**: 取消预订 — She cancelled her hotel reservation. 她取消了酒店预订。
- **a challenging task**: 一项有挑战性的任务 — This is a challenging task for the team. 这对团队来说是一项有挑战性的任务。
- **world champion**: 世界冠军 — He became the world champion in boxing. 他成为了世界拳击冠军。
